{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "567b9f268a15cf98d824d0f9354a05b70901385597bd33617cb23456a94075ab", "ja": "なかなかお休みを合わせるのも難しいけど……\nうーん、どうしようかなぁ～。", "zh": "要协调好休息时间也挺难的……\n嗯——该怎么办好呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f9d418d84b58a393c1b77b9a3878dae5e86a567f13c433d3026fe708d150b067", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れ様です。\nもしかして、休暇の予定を検討中ですか？", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。难道是在考虑休假的安排吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "b5f8fcd5f7f281d552ef91694b8c591824b5612899da8590ec0c138fdeeff0ac", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nはい、久しぶりに地元の友達に会いたいなぁって。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n嗯，我想着要不要去见见久违的老朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "4a89321f46b9fc09c53ea520658174bc27d7c775e8599a0f05b15609f6915da2", "ja": "社会人になって、会う機会も少なくなりましたから。\n{$P$}さんは、どうですか？", "zh": "参加工作之后，见面的机会也少了很多。\n{$P$}先生呢，您怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "481c634b53b1c4334157bd28b8ca7eef68fe0bc9de566b5be516583fdd9d7da9", "ja": "たまに連絡は取りますけど……。そういえば最近、\n仕事関係の人としか会ってないような……？", "zh": "偶尔还会联系……不过说起来，最近好像只和工作上的人见面……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "78051a3fc95fb72fc2de14ac414ca8dee29e7bf3b193b08c7b9f0fb138ca4ae4", "ja": "仕事関係……あ、そういえば社長さんが、\n{$P$}さんをお呼びでしたよ！", "zh": "工作上的关系……啊，说起来，社长先生好像叫了{$P$}先生过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a71847da8894385a2e4c4e74c5650772ee7938655b2c606624688a1e14a22abb", "ja": "本当ですか？　なら、すぐに向かわないとですね。\nさっそく行ってみます！", "zh": "真的吗？那我得马上过去了。\n我这就去看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6b0d06b95f5371c67df719a72eb8b381858c36af4186045856267c7d6dd3f448", "ja": "お疲れ様です！　……あれ、音無さんだけですか？\n廊下で社長の声が聞こえた気がしたんですが。", "zh": "辛苦了！……咦，只有音无小姐吗？\n我好像在走廊听到了社长的声音。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_1008_101kot", "source_sha256": "e3e61184e1015dade9fb1bee64099ab76f4b00dbf57e00e21f69bbaee7e71d35", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\nええ、社長もいますよ？　うふふっ♪", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n是啊，社长也在哦？嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_1009_president", "source_sha256": "a08ec0551d9f0421a78dae6a34a8786a05175eb76b9362feceb47e9f0d7d151a", "ja": "おお、待っていたよ君。私はここだ。\n実際には時速300キロで移動中だがね！", "zh": "哦，我一直在等你。我就在这里。\n其实我现在正以时速300公里移动着呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "acafa9a3e3bf0849857a9c2e76aa64119acfb4c14eb70bfea29f71c1cee4949d", "ja": "PCから社長の声が……？\nああ、そういうことでしたか。", "zh": "电脑里传来了社长的声音……？\n啊，原来是这么回事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "7c38dcbc5a750fd637783e4e366fcfa04c82a76f6cada205ef2d97350d36a757", "ja": "はい、リモートミーティングです。\n通話画面は、こっちのモニターで。", "zh": "对，是远程会议。\n通话画面就在这边的显示器上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "565bb196c63d92591d8ba54494ece5f8948c642b1d5f6d19fbd11dd90e931384", "ja": "いやはや、ハイテク技術は日進月歩というか、\n旅先からでも君達と会議ができるとはね！", "zh": "哎呀呀，高科技真是日新月异，没想到即使人在旅途中，也能和你们开会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a4d30f26269d2a4851af259588b048103b9ff4ec29b5d5c5bc6bf66f35f8151a", "ja": "通話の画質、すごいですね。普段と1ミリも変わりなく\n見えますよ！　……ところで、今回はどのような？", "zh": "通话的画质真好啊。看起来和平时相比连1毫米的差别都没有！……话说回来，这次是有什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "56d9ba4503ed06c65bb80a0309b332291c4a281a30abdfcddec7407c27729830", "ja": "うむ。実は……。", "zh": "嗯。其实……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "cb2e3ce7c0dfe1002b031d7e85780e1f61d9e6b9335a6e5fdaee4fea89267fc6", "ja": "いよいよこの夏より、私が密かに温めてきた、\n新プロジェクトを始めようと思う！", "zh": "这个夏天，我暗中筹备已久的\n全新企划终于要启动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "92d9c4686e71a5485e9ae46c612bde1f70b214f5a2d3e7c046f10a064654b5a9", "ja": "えっ、新プロジェクトですか！？", "zh": "咦，新项目吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "8bbce2dd5447c6244ea4531c1c8e359e6fa7b43efc30d262babedb5afa0f24c2", "ja": "{$P$}さん、詳しい話を\nお聞きになりますか？　それとも簡単に？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，您想听详细的说明，\n还是简单了解一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_1018", "source_sha256": "4c3efc3984261637615ca8eb4c858bd349914fb45653b4e592ae8ff34999d9f4", "ja": "詳しく！", "zh": "详情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_1019", "source_sha256": "1aea865851b5a125647e20c47c8da6136eee33460b1fe3571b0d0e012a95c58e", "ja": "簡単に！", "zh": "简单点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "09513abbad7c90711b8b855e3822bbf4d912077bc7567caae87385f464f877c8", "ja": "もちろん、詳しくお願いします！", "zh": "当然，请详细讲讲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "703eec1b79f2bbfc3efeb335ae80488e6f612168396b419637b540031685ed5d", "ja": "はっはっは。では私が直接話すとしよう！\n少し長くなるが、よく聞いてくれたまえ。", "zh": "哈哈哈。那么，就由我亲自来说吧！\n虽然会稍微有点长，但还请你仔细听好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "e424e813a93420a3a3b3596c351ad1bc6c1cb0f63ff94e63465cd62b2613cf21", "ja": "君とアイドル諸君の活躍により、劇場公演はいつも満員\n御礼、遠方から足を運んでくれるファンも多くなった。", "zh": "在你和各位偶像的活跃之下，剧场公演总是场场爆满，\n特意从远方赶来的粉丝也变多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_2003_president", "source_sha256": "ccdcaf9c04f8bf335e9baee38a83347d4c17061e4ee7738afeecaa20245a2a2c", "ja": "しかし、劇場に行きたい、アイドル諸君に会いたいと\n思っていても、実際には難しいファンも多い。", "zh": "然而，即使想去剧场、见见各位偶像，\n现实中也有很多粉丝难以做到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_2004_president", "source_sha256": "a36bf201718538ea2a3e1ee063572e6315f304a626115fc1194ce0e160cb4c21", "ja": "そこでだ！　人と人との距離、直接会うことの意義が\n問われる、こんな時代だからこそ！", "zh": "所以说！正因为这是一个人与人之间的距离、亲自见面的意义受到拷问的时代！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_2005_president", "source_sha256": "d2af3748d50e6dda425251f9b859d8d451b5ec64c6fd399db07649e75ef198ed", "ja": "これより我が765プロは、\n全国ツアーに打って出ようと思う！", "zh": "接下来，我们的765Pro打算进军全国巡演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_2006_president", "source_sha256": "c8bdcb694674e74ae6cbe25d9f68dfa1d8e9ba5aadabb95cf019d57181f98fda", "ja": "まず、52人のアイドル諸君を4つのチームに分け……", "zh": "首先，将52位偶像分为4个队伍……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_2007_president", "source_sha256": "b30c2d1642fefbd14af0369a53b6bf1e38b976e5b63252584530535676a6d1b7", "ja": "3か月ずつ順番に、チームが担当するエリアでの\n公演を開催するのだよ！", "zh": "每隔3个月轮流在队伍负责的区域\n举办公演哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_2008_president", "source_sha256": "e91358796408fbe58d14f89142db56525e96affbc9bc05aab9b120af34a19445", "ja": "たとえるなら、ゆっくり流れゆく季節が徐々に広がり、\n各地の風景を変えていくように公演を広げていく……。", "zh": "打个比方，就像缓缓流逝的季节逐渐铺展开来，改变各地的景色一样，将公演不断扩展下去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_2009_president", "source_sha256": "2e43259ec62f819f2e46acdd6bbcc64ad1ed04d59910be1b83f40441801df468", "ja": "文字通り、劇場公演を全国に届けるのだ！\n名付けて！！", "zh": "字如其意，将剧场公演传达到全国各地吧！\n其名为！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_2010_president", "source_sha256": "0be6578ec9cfbe923e7366e43edb49e4ee0dc51fd5012c2171ba76ae799d441b", "ja": "『ミリオンシアターシーズン』プロジェクト！！", "zh": "《百万剧场季度》企划！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_2011_p", "source_sha256": "7f3c32e0710cf345fd7b5927970817e5496e00f450fb064e3dd5299ab7c624ea", "ja": "『ミリオンシアターシーズン』プロジェクト……！！", "zh": "『百万剧场季』企划……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_2012_president", "source_sha256": "75cdc86fe8a63ea265ace48c03274ae6a3e7df433cfcc5015852c153cf707296", "ja": "新たなプロジェクトのために、アイドル諸君にもまた、\n新たなチームを組んでもらおうと思っている。", "zh": "为了新的企划，我想请各位偶像再次组建新的团队。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_2013_president", "source_sha256": "92ae6a10a790bdc500346ffda3b246ea40aca0ac832c912890567b04fdac1e26", "ja": "52人の個性が集まる4つのチーム……。そう！\n悩んだ私は手品をしている時にピンと来た！", "zh": "52个人的个性汇聚而成的4个队伍……。对！\n烦恼的我在变魔术的时候灵光一闪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_2014_president", "source_sha256": "168c637738205856cf7484f218a8c935b9bfb56b2208a229cc61f596dad66789", "ja": "『ダイヤ』！　『クラブ』！\n『ハート』！　『スペード』！", "zh": "“方块”！　“梅花”！\n“红桃”！　“黑桃”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_2015_president", "source_sha256": "9411a5994cf603335924b0ab5c121bd76ff457b3367a9c9d2cd194b37a1ca674", "ja": "アイドル諸君には、このトランプのマーク、\n『スート』を冠した4チームに分かれて……", "zh": "各位偶像将分成以这副扑克牌的花色“花色”为名的4支队伍……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_2016_president", "source_sha256": "1f4c3023cfbfdeab995ca93978db26bc3c4be5c6b157844304d29a9ae57a471c", "ja": "順番に全国を巡り、各地に劇場公演を届けてもらう。\nこれが新プロジェクトの詳細だ！", "zh": "按顺序巡游全国各地，为各地带去剧场公演。\n这就是新项目的详情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_2017_p", "source_sha256": "64bbfddc440781600c59089849a6db6408d84a3c567c74ed619a10a36771299c", "ja": "なるほど……。\nよく分かりました。ありがとうございます！", "zh": "原来如此……\n我明白了。谢谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_3000_p", "source_sha256": "61dfc6165726abf8171cff42f5dd318d0a92946a014a29cf22b89a7067a4a903", "ja": "もちろん、簡単にお願いします！", "zh": "当然可以，请尽量讲得简单一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_3001_101kot", "source_sha256": "975b7a6e3e0a7ef76c2c9f41c485ee0382ba9cd19fa45d11ef1fe0851805b281", "ja": "ですよね。\nでは、こちらの企画書をご覧ください♪", "zh": "就是嘛。\n那么，请看看这份企划书吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_3003_p", "source_sha256": "6b62ae94709caf460c7aac7df291799d4f0b9da59b150c150b10aaedca150b9d", "ja": "なるほど、「劇場のアイドルを4チームに分けての\n全国公演ツアー」というわけですか！", "zh": "原来如此，也就是说，要把剧场的偶像分成4个队伍，举办全国巡演啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_4000_president", "source_sha256": "524c6f81cac0c5e245a58b732e6a8cc7b14b3a3d38ea21468440c087ce55ea64", "ja": "会いたいと願う人がいるなら、どこまでも会いに行く。\n彼女達の魅力で、各エリアを彩って行こうじゃないか。", "zh": "只要有人期盼与她们相见，就去到天涯海角与他们相会吧。\n用她们的魅力，为各个区域增添光彩吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_4001_president", "source_sha256": "1581728e233e986bb040feca31bf2bb878d5f53bd99c0cb6c0ca021d40e0c243", "ja": "もちろん、君には彼女達の支えとなって、\n共に全国を駆け巡って欲しい。やってくれるかね？", "zh": "当然，我希望你能成为她们的支柱，\n和她们一同奔赴全国各地。你愿意接受吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_4002", "source_sha256": "d7dc2c584dab1c79c1051244bd1990da52c55f4f5fffd94bd0097c76a51bd1ca", "ja": "もちろん！", "zh": "那当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_5000_p", "source_sha256": "3487273097cfd0093283d4adcb48f4a46e7051aeb9605b465c8b6de23809fef5", "ja": "もちろんです！　社長のご期待……いえ、\nファンのみんなの期待に応えるためにも、全力で！", "zh": "那是当然！　为了不辜负社长的期望……不，\n为了回应所有粉丝的期待，我一定会全力以赴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_5001_president", "source_sha256": "9ceaa4753dbfa62dd633fb39c3570456b38d0ed408c77f2e52304856026b15f4", "ja": "うむ！　じつに君らしい、いい返事だ！\nひとつ、よろしく頼むよ～！", "zh": "嗯！真是很有你的风格，是个不错的回答！\n这件事就拜托你啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_5002_president", "source_sha256": "579604eb277d3770b19c2ee10a0b4bfc697dec256451ba2be34a6f2ef600e126", "ja": "と、キレイにまとまったところで……音無君？\n通話を終わりにするには、どうすればよかったかな？", "zh": "就在一切顺利告一段落的时候……音无君？\n要结束通话的话，该怎么做来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_5003_101kot", "source_sha256": "f01ff15ceceb2148113e2c016bd9a0d2a0156df2fd16fadb20d4e7232e814341", "ja": "え？　あ、社長ってスマホからでしたよね？　アプリは\n違う画面だから……ちょ、ちょっと待ってくださいね！", "zh": "诶？啊，社长是用手机打来的对吧？应用界面不一样……请、请稍等一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0194_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_intro_5004_p", "source_sha256": "fafe0ff34472a44df669c118159aabc04c6bf8248b5c8350eff6b7a5e66f8161", "ja": "（全国ツアーか……本当に大きなスケールの\n企画になりそうだ。しっかり、やっていこう！）", "zh": "（全国巡演啊……看来会成为一个规模非常大的企划。一定要好好干！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
